@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
[*] --> Unregistered : Open Registration Form

state Unregistered {
}

Unregistered --> ActiveProfile : submitRegistration() [credentials valid]\n/ create Customer
ActiveProfile --> ActiveWithVerifiedAddress : addDeliveryAddress() [distance <= maxDistance]
ActiveProfile --> ActiveWithOutOfRangeAddress : addDeliveryAddress() [distance > maxDistance]

ActiveWithVerifiedAddress --> ActiveWithVerifiedAddress : updateAddress() / recalculateDistance()
ActiveWithOutOfRangeAddress --> ActiveWithVerifiedAddress : updateAddress() [new distance <= maxDistance]
ActiveWithVerifiedAddress --> AddressArchived : deleteAddress() [not attached to active order]
AddressArchived --> [*]
@enduml